# Build context for .sandcastle/Dockerfile (built with `--dockerfile`, so the
# context is the repo root). The warm-store layer only needs the lockfile +
# workspace manifest + the vendored tarball (referenced via file: in the
# lockfile) — exclude everything else so the context transfer stays tiny.
*
!pnpm-lock.yaml
!pnpm-workspace.yaml
!vendor
!vendor/**
